1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,220
Anak kerap sakit kepala?

2
00:00:01,920 --> 00:00:03,740
Mata pun boleh jadi

3
00:00:03,440 --> 00:00:04,940
salah satu sebab.

4
00:00:04,640 --> 00:00:06,420
Kalau anak rabun atau

5
00:00:06,120 --> 00:00:07,580
ada masalah penglihatan

6
00:00:07,280 --> 00:00:08,760
yang belum dibetulkan,

7
00:00:08,460 --> 00:00:11,640
mata kena kerja lebih kuat,

8
00:00:11,340 --> 00:00:13,020
terutamanya lepas baca

9
00:00:12,720 --> 00:00:13,980
atau main gajet.

10
00:00:13,680 --> 00:00:16,720
Itu boleh buat mata penat

11
00:00:16,420 --> 00:00:18,220
dan sakit kepala.

12
00:00:17,920 --> 00:00:19,800
Tapi jangan panik.

13
00:00:19,580 --> 00:00:21,060
Sakit kepala budak

14
00:00:20,760 --> 00:00:22,540
biasanya bukan serius.

15
00:00:22,240 --> 00:00:24,120
Punca lain termasuk

16
00:00:23,820 --> 00:00:25,140
kurang minum air,

17
00:00:24,840 --> 00:00:27,380
stres dan kurang tidur.

18
00:00:27,380 --> 00:00:28,560
Fakta di Malaysia:

19
00:00:28,260 --> 00:00:30,040
rabun jauh kanak-kanak

20
00:00:29,740 --> 00:00:32,480
dianggarkan 9.8%

21
00:00:32,180 --> 00:00:34,340
pada umur 7 tahun.

22
00:00:34,460 --> 00:00:37,860
Naik kepada 34.4%

23
00:00:37,560 --> 00:00:39,500
pada umur 15 tahun.

24
00:00:39,600 --> 00:00:41,640
Anak pun sering tak sedar

25
00:00:41,340 --> 00:00:43,060
penglihatan dia bermasalah.

26
00:00:42,760 --> 00:00:46,640
Jadi kalau sakit kepala berulang,

27
00:00:46,560 --> 00:00:48,960
bawa buat pemeriksaan mata,

28
00:00:48,660 --> 00:00:50,960
atau boleh dapatkan suplemen

29
00:00:50,660 --> 00:00:52,840
untuk penjagaan kesihatan mata

30
00:00:52,540 --> 00:00:53,680
dengan segera.

31
00:00:54,180 --> 00:00:55,440
Jangan tunggu lagi.

32
00:00:55,300 --> 00:00:57,000
Jumpa sekarang.

33
00:00:57,660 --> 00:00:59,600
Dapatkan rawatan sekarang.

34
00:00:59,740 --> 00:01:00,460
Bye bye.
